    "Groups gather projects that belong together, such as Grants or Courses.": {
      "comment": "Explains what a group is, under the New Group field",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gruppen fassen Projekte zusammen, die zusammengehören, etwa Förderungen oder Kurse."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los grupos reúnen proyectos que van juntos, como Becas o Cursos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
